WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
In 1930, Albert Einstein and Elsa Einstein arrived in San Diego on the Belgenland.

c2
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:14.153
On Dec. 31, 1930, Einstein and Mrs. Einstein were with a reception committee at San Diego.

c3
00:00:14.503 --> 00:00:18.556
In San Diego, Einstein was greeted by Mayor Harry C. Clark.

